{"version":1,"entries":[{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"puts / print / p","summary":"puts は改行付き出力、print は改行なし、p は inspect 形式（デバッグ向け）で出力します。","examples":[{"code":"puts \"こんにちは\"\np [1, \"a\"]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0001"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"変数","summary":"型の宣言は不要。小文字で始めます。","examples":[{"code":"name = \"太郎\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0002"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"定数","summary":"大文字で始まる名前。再代入すると警告が出ます。","examples":[{"code":"PI = 3.14","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0003"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"コメント","summary":"# から行末まで。=begin ～ =end で複数行。","examples":[{"code":"# メモ","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0004"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"文字列の式展開","summary":"ダブルクォート内で #{ } に式を書くと値が埋め込まれます。","examples":[{"code":"puts \"合計は#{1 + 2}\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0005"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"シンボル","summary":":name のように書く、軽量で変更できない名前。ハッシュのキーによく使います。","examples":[{"code":":apple","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0006"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"nil","summary":"「何もない」を表す値。偽として扱われます（false と nil だけが偽）。","examples":[{"code":"x = nil","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0007"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"真偽値","summary":"true と false。0 や空文字も真として扱われます。","examples":[{"code":"puts \"真\" if 0","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0008"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"gets","summary":"標準入力から1行読みます。chomp で改行を取り除きます。","examples":[{"code":"n = gets.chomp.to_i","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0009"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"require / require_relative","summary":"ライブラリや別ファイルを読み込みます。","examples":[{"code":"require \"json\"\nrequire_relative \"util\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0010"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"Everything is an object","summary":"数値も nil もすべてオブジェクトで、メソッドを持ちます。","examples":[{"code":"3.times { puts \"hi\" }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0011"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"多重代入","summary":"複数の変数にまとめて代入します。","examples":[{"code":"a, b = 1, 2\na, b = b, a","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0012"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"安全参照演算子","summary":"&. は nil のときエラーにせず nil を返します。","examples":[{"code":"user&.name","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0013"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"基本","term":"||=","summary":"nil または false のときだけ代入します。","examples":[{"code":"@cache ||= load","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0014"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"演算子","term":"**","summary":"べき乗。","examples":[{"code":"2 ** 10 # => 1024","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0015"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"演算子","term":"<=> （宇宙船演算子）","summary":"比較して -1, 0, 1 を返します。並べ替えで使われます。","examples":[{"code":"1 <=> 2 # => -1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0016"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"演算子","term":"== と equal?","summary":"== は値が等しいか、equal? は同じオブジェクトか調べます。","examples":[{"code":"\"a\" == \"a\" # => true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0017"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"演算子","term":"=~ / match?","summary":"正規表現との一致を調べます。","examples":[{"code":"\"abc\".match?(/b/)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0018"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"演算子","term":"範囲 .. と ...","summary":".. は終端を含み、... は含みません。","examples":[{"code":"(1..5).to_a\n(1...5).to_a","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0019"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"演算子","term":"三項演算子","summary":"条件 ? A : B。","examples":[{"code":"x > 0 ? \"正\" : \"負\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0020"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"if / elsif / else","summary":"条件分岐。後置の if も書けます。","examples":[{"code":"if n > 0\n  puts \"正\"\nelsif n < 0\n  puts \"負\"\nelse\n  puts \"零\"\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0021"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"unless","summary":"条件が偽のときに実行します。if の反対です。","examples":[{"code":"puts \"未入力\" unless name","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0022"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"case / when","summary":"値や範囲、クラスで分岐します。","examples":[{"code":"case n\nwhen 1..3 then \"小\"\nwhen 4.. then \"大\"\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0023"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"while / until","summary":"条件が真の間／偽の間、繰り返します。","examples":[{"code":"while n > 0\n  n -= 1\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0024"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"for","summary":"範囲や配列を順に処理します。ただし each が一般的です。","examples":[{"code":"for i in 1..3\n  puts i\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0025"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"loop","summary":"無限ループ。break で抜けます。","examples":[{"code":"loop do\n  break if done\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0026"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"break / next / redo","summary":"ループを抜ける／次へ進む／やり直す。","examples":[{"code":"next if n.odd?","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0027"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"begin / rescue / ensure","summary":"例外処理。ensure は必ず実行されます。","examples":[{"code":"begin\n  Integer(\"x\")\nrescue ArgumentError => e\n  puts e.message\nensure\n  puts \"終わり\"\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0028"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"raise","summary":"例外を発生させます。","examples":[{"code":"raise ArgumentError, \"不正な値\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0029"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"retry","summary":"rescue 内で最初からやり直します。","examples":[{"code":"retry if (tries += 1) < 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0030"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"制御構文","term":"catch / throw","summary":"深い入れ子から一気に抜ける仕組み。","examples":[{"code":"catch(:done) { throw :done }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0031"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"def","summary":"メソッドを定義します。最後に評価された式が戻り値になります。","examples":[{"code":"def add(a, b)\n  a + b\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0032"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"デフォルト引数","summary":"省略時の初期値。","examples":[{"code":"def hi(name = \"ゲスト\")\n  \"こんにちは#{name}\"\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0033"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"キーワード引数","summary":"名前付きで渡す引数。順序を気にせず読みやすい。","examples":[{"code":"def f(name:, age: 20)\nend\nf(name: \"A\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0034"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"可変長引数","summary":"*args で複数、**opts でキーワードをまとめて受け取ります。","examples":[{"code":"def f(*args, **opts); end","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0035"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"戻り値 return","summary":"途中で値を返したいときに使います。省略もできます。","examples":[{"code":"return 0 if n.zero?","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0036"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"疑問符・感嘆符のメソッド","summary":"? は真偽を返す、! は元のオブジェクトを変える、という慣習です。","examples":[{"code":"\"abc\".upcase!","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0037"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"ブロックを受け取る yield","summary":"メソッドに渡されたブロックを呼びます。","examples":[{"code":"def twice\n  yield\n  yield\nend\ntwice { puts \"hi\" }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0038"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"block_given?","summary":"ブロックが渡されたか調べます。","examples":[{"code":"yield if block_given?","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0039"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"&ブロック引数","summary":"ブロックを Proc として受け取ります。","examples":[{"code":"def f(&blk)\n  blk.call\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0040"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"Proc / lambda","summary":"処理をオブジェクトにしたもの。lambda は引数の数に厳密です。","examples":[{"code":"sq = ->(x) { x * x }\nsq.call(3)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0041"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"メソッドチェーン","summary":"メソッドをドットでつなげて続けて書きます。","examples":[{"code":"\" a \".strip.upcase","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0042"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"method_missing","summary":"存在しないメソッドが呼ばれたときの処理を決めます。","examples":[{"code":"def method_missing(name, *args); end","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0043"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"メソッド","term":"alias","summary":"メソッドに別名を付けます。","examples":[{"code":"alias_method :old, :new","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0044"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"配列リテラル","summary":"[ ] で作る。型が混在してもよい。","examples":[{"code":"a = [1, \"b\", :c]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0045"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"%w","summary":"文字列の配列を手短に書きます。","examples":[{"code":"%w[a b c] # => [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0046"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"<< / push","summary":"末尾に追加。","examples":[{"code":"a << 4","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0047"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"pop / shift / unshift","summary":"末尾／先頭から取り出す／先頭に追加。","examples":[{"code":"a.shift","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0048"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"each","summary":"各要素に処理を実行します。","examples":[{"code":"[1, 2].each { |n| puts n }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0049"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"each_with_index","summary":"添字つきで処理します。","examples":[{"code":"a.each_with_index { |v, i| puts \"#{i}:#{v}\" }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0050"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"map（collect）","summary":"各要素を変換した新しい配列を返します。","examples":[{"code":"[1, 2].map { |n| n * 2 }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0051"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"select / reject","summary":"条件に合う／合わない要素を集めます。","examples":[{"code":"(1..6).select(&:even?)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0052"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"find（detect）","summary":"最初に条件に合う要素。","examples":[{"code":"a.find { |n| n > 3 }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0053"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"inject / reduce","summary":"畳み込みで1つの値にします。","examples":[{"code":"[1, 2, 3].inject(:+) # => 6","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0054"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"sum / min / max","summary":"合計・最小・最大。","examples":[{"code":"[3, 1].max","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0055"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"sort / sort_by","summary":"並べ替え。sort_by は基準を指定。","examples":[{"code":"users.sort_by { |u| u.age }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0056"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"uniq / compact","summary":"重複を除く／nil を除く。","examples":[{"code":"[1, 1, nil].compact.uniq","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0057"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"flatten","summary":"入れ子の配列を平らにします。","examples":[{"code":"[[1], [2, [3]]].flatten","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0058"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"zip","summary":"複数の配列を組にして並べます。","examples":[{"code":"[1, 2].zip(%w[a b])","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0059"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"each_slice / each_cons","summary":"n個ずつ／連続n個ずつ取り出します。","examples":[{"code":"(1..6).each_slice(2).to_a","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0060"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"include?","summary":"含まれるか調べます。","examples":[{"code":"a.include?(3)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0061"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"first / last","summary":"先頭／末尾。引数で個数も指定可能。","examples":[{"code":"a.first(2)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0062"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"group_by / partition","summary":"グループ分け／真偽で2つに分ける。","examples":[{"code":"(1..6).partition(&:even?)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0063"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"tally","summary":"各要素の出現回数を数えます。","examples":[{"code":"%w[a b a].tally # => {\"a\"=>2, \"b\"=>1}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0064"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"配列","term":"Enumerable","summary":"each を持つクラスに map や select などをまとめて与えるモジュール。","examples":[{"code":"include Enumerable","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0065"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"ハッシュ{ }","summary":"キーと値の組。シンボルキーは name: \"太郎\" と書けます。","examples":[{"code":"h = { name: \"太郎\", age: 20 }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0066"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"[] で取得","summary":"キーから値を取得。なければ nil。","examples":[{"code":"h[:name]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0067"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"fetch","summary":"キーがなければ例外、またはデフォルト値を返します。","examples":[{"code":"h.fetch(:zip, \"不明\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0068"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"each","summary":"キーと値を順に処理。","examples":[{"code":"h.each { |k, v| puts \"#{k}=#{v}\" }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0069"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"keys / values","summary":"キー／値の配列。","examples":[{"code":"h.keys","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0070"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"key? / has_key?","summary":"キーがあるか調べます。","examples":[{"code":"h.key?(:name)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0071"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"merge","summary":"ハッシュを合成します。","examples":[{"code":"h.merge(city: \"東京\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0072"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"transform_values","summary":"値だけを変換します。","examples":[{"code":"h.transform_values { |v| v * 2 }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0073"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"Hash.new(0)","summary":"存在しないキーの初期値を決めます。数え上げに便利。","examples":[{"code":"c = Hash.new(0)\nc[\"a\"] += 1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0074"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"dig","summary":"入れ子の値を安全に取り出します。","examples":[{"code":"h.dig(:a, :b)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0075"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ハッシュ","term":"to_a / to_h","summary":"配列とハッシュの変換。","examples":[{"code":"h.to_a","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0076"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"length","summary":"文字数。","examples":[{"code":"\"あいう\".length # => 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0077"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"upcase / downcase / capitalize","summary":"大文字／小文字／先頭だけ大文字。","examples":[{"code":"\"abc\".capitalize","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0078"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"strip","summary":"前後の空白を除去。","examples":[{"code":"\" a \".strip","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0079"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"split / join","summary":"区切りで分割／結合。","examples":[{"code":"\"a,b\".split(\",\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0080"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"sub / gsub","summary":"最初の／すべての一致を置換。","examples":[{"code":"\"a-b\".gsub(\"-\", \"+\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0081"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"include? / start_with?","summary":"含む／先頭が。","examples":[{"code":"\"abc\".start_with?(\"a\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0082"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"[ ]（部分取得）","summary":"添字や範囲で部分文字列を取る。","examples":[{"code":"\"abcdef\"[1, 3] # => \"bcd\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0083"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"format / sprintf","summary":"書式付き文字列。","examples":[{"code":"format(\"%05.1f\", 3.14159)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0084"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"to_i / to_f / to_s / to_sym","summary":"型変換。","examples":[{"code":"\"12\".to_i","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0085"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"freeze","summary":"オブジェクトを変更不可にします。","examples":[{"code":"# frozen_string_literal: true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0086"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"ヒアドキュメント","summary":"長い文字列。<<~ でインデントを取り除けます。","examples":[{"code":"text = <<~EOS\n  行1\n  行2\nEOS","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0087"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"正規表現","summary":"/.../ で書くパターン。名前付きキャプチャも使えます。","examples":[{"code":"/(?<y>\\d+)-(?<m>\\d+)/ =~ \"2026-11\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0088"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"文字列","term":"encoding / force_encoding","summary":"文字コードの確認・指定。","examples":[{"code":"str.encode(\"UTF-8\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0089"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"class","summary":"オブジェクトの設計図。クラス名は大文字で始めます。","examples":[{"code":"class Dog\n  def initialize(name)\n    @name = name\n  end\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0090"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"initialize","summary":"new で呼ばれる初期化メソッド。","examples":[{"code":"def initialize(name)\n  @name = name\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0091"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"インスタンス変数 @","summary":"オブジェクトごとのデータ。外からは直接見えません。","examples":[{"code":"@name = name","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0092"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"attr_accessor / reader / writer","summary":"読み書きのメソッドを自動で作ります。","examples":[{"code":"attr_accessor :name","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0093"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"クラスメソッド","summary":"self. を付けて定義し、クラスから直接呼ぶメソッド。","examples":[{"code":"def self.create; end","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0094"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"クラス変数 @@","summary":"クラス全体で共有される変数。継承で意図せず共有されるため注意。","examples":[{"code":"@@count = 0","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0095"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"継承 <","summary":"親クラスを引き継ぐ。super で親のメソッドを呼ぶ。","examples":[{"code":"class Puppy < Dog\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0096"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"super","summary":"親クラスの同名メソッドを呼びます。","examples":[{"code":"def initialize(n)\n  super(n)\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0097"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"public / protected / private","summary":"メソッドの公開範囲。","examples":[{"code":"private\n\ndef secret; end","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0098"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"module","summary":"メソッドの部品集。include でインスタンスに、extend でクラスに追加します。","examples":[{"code":"module Greet\n  def hi; \"hi\"; end\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0099"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"Mixin","summary":"モジュールを取り込んで機能を追加する Ruby の多重継承の代わり。","examples":[{"code":"include Comparable","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0100"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"to_s の再定義","summary":"puts したときの表示を決めます。","examples":[{"code":"def to_s\n  @name\nend","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0101"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"Struct","summary":"属性だけのクラスを短く作ります。","examples":[{"code":"P = Struct.new(:x, :y)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0102"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"Comparable","summary":"<=> を定義すると比較演算子が使えるようになる。","examples":[{"code":"include Comparable","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0103"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"メタプログラミング","summary":"実行中にメソッドやクラスを動的に作る技法。","examples":[{"code":"define_method(:hi) { \"hi\" }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0104"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"クラス","term":"モンキーパッチ","summary":"既存クラスにメソッドを追加・上書きすること。影響範囲が大きいので注意。","examples":[{"code":"class String; def shout; upcase; end; end","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0105"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ファイルとIO","term":"File.read","summary":"ファイル全体を文字列で読む。","examples":[{"code":"File.read(\"a.txt\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0106"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ファイルとIO","term":"File.open","summary":"ブロック付きで開くと自動的に閉じます。","examples":[{"code":"File.open(\"a.txt\", \"w\") { |f| f.puts \"hi\" }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0107"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ファイルとIO","term":"File.readlines","summary":"行ごとの配列にして読む。","examples":[{"code":"File.readlines(\"a.txt\", chomp: true)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0108"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ファイルとIO","term":"Dir.glob","summary":"パターンに合うファイルの一覧。","examples":[{"code":"Dir.glob(\"*.rb\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0109"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ファイルとIO","term":"JSON","summary":"JSON と Ruby の値を変換します。","examples":[{"code":"JSON.parse('{\"a\":1}')\nh.to_json","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0110"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ファイルとIO","term":"CSV","summary":"CSV の読み書きを行う標準ライブラリ。","examples":[{"code":"CSV.foreach(\"a.csv\", headers: true) { |r| p r }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0111"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ファイルとIO","term":"Net::HTTP","summary":"HTTP 通信を行う標準ライブラリ。","examples":[{"code":"Net::HTTP.get(URI(\"https://example.com\"))","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0112"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ファイルとIO","term":"ARGV / ENV","summary":"コマンドライン引数／環境変数。","examples":[{"code":"ARGV[0]\nENV[\"HOME\"]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0113"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ツールとRails","term":"gem","summary":"Ruby のライブラリ（パッケージ）。","examples":[{"code":"gem install rails","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"ruby-0114"},{"lang":"ruby","category":"ツールとRails","term":"Bundler / Gemfile","summary":